 to their friends) right away.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;THANK YOU  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;free for now</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/1688838636809186393'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/1688838636809186393'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html?showComment=1473041582867#c1688838636809186393' title=''/><author><name>free for now</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07632820566793071298</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8610339541065890946' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/8610339541065890946' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1455007207"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 4, 2016 at 9:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-5020282132688282671</id><published>2016-09-04T19:05:44.703-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-04T19:05:44.703-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Growing up in the &amp;#39;60&amp;#39;s, it was always tho...</title><content type='html'>Growing up in the &amp;#39;60&amp;#39;s, it was always those &amp;quot;Russian Commies&amp;quot; that were behind the deterioration and corruption of society, whether the anti-war movement, liberal welfare programs, sex-drugs-rock and roll,feminism, abortion rights. etc.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Now that these elements have pretty much taken over society, or at least society as presented to us in the Mass Media, the resistance and push-back against all this liberalism is the fault, of who?  Well, of course those now &amp;quot;Reactionary Russians&amp;quot; and Vlad the Bad Putin.  They are the ones behind the &amp;quot;Right Wing Conspiracy&amp;quot;, as our dear leader Hillary says.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/5020282132688282671'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/5020282132688282671'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html?showComment=1473033944703#c5020282132688282671' title=''/><author><name>PNW_DPer</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16203324465643216620</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8610339541065890946' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/8610339541065890946' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-525257324"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 4, 2016 at 7:05 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-7505675372710377288</id><published>2016-09-02T14:21:09.108-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-02T14:21:09.108-05:00</updated><title type='text'>I am in the process of reading the book. So far it...</title><content type='html'>I am in the process of reading the book. So far it is well worth the