.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/6762659648614034721'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html?showComment=1472841848545#c6762659648614034721' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8610339541065890946' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/8610339541065890946' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1141351138"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2016 at 1:44 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-3882822745174375737</id><published>2016-09-02T08:06:38.682-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-02T08:06:38.682-05:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s just like I&amp;#39;ve been saying for a long...</title><content type='html'>It&amp;#39;s just like I&amp;#39;ve been saying for a long time. If we want to save and preserve our country and it&amp;#39;s moral foundation of freedom and liberty, when they fire the first unconstitutional shot at innocent, patriot Americans, we are going to have to hunt down and round up all the American, Socialist subversives like Bill Ayers, his friends and his wife, thousands of ensconced liberal college, high school and grade school indoctrinators, socialist media types, socialist politicians and give them two options. Either they surrender their citizenship and self-deport, or they die. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/3882822745174375737'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/3882822745174375737'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html?showComment=1472821598682#c3882822745174375737' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8610339541065890946' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/8610339541065890946' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1377076426"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2016 at 8:06 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8450812290865448218</id><published>2016-09-02T06:20:16.058-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-02T06:20:16.058-05:00</updated><title type='text'>The Six Laws of Survival: Strategies For Beating t...</title><content type='html'>The Six Laws of Survival: Strategies For Beating the Worst Case Scenario&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;ReadyNutrition Guys and Gals, we just finished a series on how to escape from Bill Ayers’ Summer Reeducation Camp (or Gulag 17, depending on the situation).  Now we will cover one of the most important elements of all: How to stay out of the “Happy” Camp.  Best thing of all: do not go in.  Easier said than done, however, there are some things you can do beforehand that will increase your chances of staying out of the Gulag.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;These things are not complicated, however, they will require both willpower and action.  They will not be things that happen on their own.  In order to stay out of a camp, you must do something very important:&lt;br /&gt; You must do things that others do not do, and you must not do what others do.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Let us run with this concept in a scenario:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You’re in bed…it’s a Saturday morning, and you don’t have to go to any of your 3 jobs today until noon.  Your battery-powered clock seems to have stopped at 5:15 am.  Puzzled you hear the drone of jet engines, and all of a sudden the house seems as if it is shaking.  You jump up and run to the front door and as you walk onto the front porch, all hell is breaking loose.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; Your mind is playing, “For Whom the Bell Tolls” by Metallica as you look up and see dozens of aircraft flying West to East, disgorging sesame seeds that sprout parachutes by the thousands, all coming down into your neighborhood.  “Red Dawn” isn’t playing: it is happening, and you’re in it.  Your neighbors didn’t bother to come wake you up; however, they’re working on starting their cars, with no success.  The paratroopers are landing, and a large crowd of people is running down Main Street to the tune of automatic gunfire in the distance.  Yep, you guessed it!  America has been invaded, and chances are you are not going to be handing out a Slurpee this afternoon.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Now what?  You must fall upon the six laws of survival or else all could be lost.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://readynutrition.com/resources/the-six-laws-of-survival-strategies-for-beating-the-worst-case-scenario_13122015/</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/8450812290865448218'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/8450812290865448218'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html?showComment=1472815216058#c8450812290865448218' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8610339541065890946' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/8610339541065890946' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1003021215"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2016 at 6:20 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-4116133042398169824</id><published>2016-09-02T05:28:37.695-05:00</published><updated>2016-09-02T05:28:37.695-05:00</updated><title type='text'>Let&amp;#39;s keep the horse before the cart here. The...</title><content type='html'>Let&amp;#39;s keep the horse before the cart here. The money-powerful banker&amp;#39;s were the ones who financed the Bolshevik revolution and are the ones who always intended a merger of Soviet-style government with the American People. That being said, it&amp;#39;s their money financing the brainwashing of Americans (with the help of CIA/Skull and Bones scumbags) through distractions such as Hollywood, sports, art, music and every other avenue of deception they can use; with nonsense being taught in schools as the pinnacle of this deception. And this entire deception really is very similar to &amp;quot;The Matrix&amp;quot;. When one is lost in it, it seems real enough and makes absolute sense. But it&amp;#39;s also easy enough for anyone who really wants to, to break out of this &amp;quot;Matrix&amp;quot; and see the truth for what it is. The key phrase here being &amp;quot;wants to&amp;quot;. The distractions are comfortable for much of the people and for the hard-boiled Marxists the deception itself represents some utopian reality that can, obviously to anyone with the ability for critical thinking, never exist. And now, with the dissolution of the Soviet Union, the deception continues here in America at a furious pace, which should make it obvious that someone else other than the Soviets are behind it...Personally I believe that parents who are aren&amp;#39;t lost in this Matrix can give their kids enough understanding of this on a simpler level to ward off the deception from taking hold of them if taught at an early enough age. But it takes work, and far too many Americans are just too friggin&amp;#39; lazy. And just for the record, G. Edward Griffin has so many videos with so much great information. God bless him for fighting the good fight all these years</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/4116133042398169824'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/8610339541065890946/comments/default/4116133042398169824'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='../../../2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html?showComment=1472812117695#c4116133042398169824' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='/sipseystreetirregulars.blogspot.com/2016/09/deception-was-my-job-interview-with-kgb.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-7575061201749703300.post-8610339541065890946' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/7575061201749703300/posts/default/8610339541065890946' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1464333804"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2016 at 5:28 AM"/></entry></feed>